# Rust build output (was covered by the nullDC-rust root .gitignore)
target/

# src/wasm/aica-dsp/ is generated by `npm run build:dspsim` (wasm-pack) but is
# committed on purpose, so a fresh clone type-checks, builds and runs without
# Rust. wasm-pack drops a catch-all .gitignore into its output directory;
# build:dspsim deletes it again so regenerated files show up in `git status`.
